    "title": "Adapt Starter Course - Introduction",
    "displayTitle": "Adapt Starter Course - Introduction",
    "body": "<p>Welcome to the Adapt Start Course - a unique starter&nbsp;template designed to help teams create courses faster and more efficiently, without the need to worry about settings or other repetitive tasks that are required when first designing&nbsp;a new course.&nbsp;</p>",
